  message: "Cross-item review 2026-05-17: verify-claims-2026-05-16 triad with INV-zudak (wrapper-gap subset — Path.mkdir) and WI-dozon (short-name-collision FP subset — taint_refine). All three partition the same 7/18 violations. This item changes the contract (zone semantics) so it touches both the claim YAML and AUTO_SINK_ZONE_MAP; the other two leave the contract untouched and fix producer/refinement code. Recommend deciding the zone split here first because it determines what counts as a wrapper-gap (INV-zudak) and a FP (WI-dozon) in the post-fix world."  # 4781
