  message: "Fixed in PR #3875 (15393d76da). AUTO_SINK_ZONE_MAP[subprocess] now routes to its own subprocess zone (was host_fs). Built-in zone vocabulary 5 -> 6. Empirical: verify-claims --claims docs/hypergumbo.claims.yaml goes 7/18 -> 4/18 violations; all *-no-host-fs install/build-grammars claims now confirmed. Remaining 4 violations are short-name-collision FPs (replace/write/run) which are WI-dozon's territory. ADR-0017 + spec + self-catalog README updated."  # 130b
